Package: cache-proxy
Version: VERSION_PLACEHOLDER
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Internal <root@localhost>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), openssl, adduser
Description: Caching forward proxy for software downloads, with a web UI
 Caches installer and update downloads (Windows/Linux software, generic
 vendor installers) across all clients transparently via TLS-interception,
 plus a browsable/searchable web UI with per-client usage logging. See
 /usr/share/doc/cache-proxy/README.md.
